\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003e3. Consider Longevity:\\u003c/strong\\u003e A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\\\\\"Tiny\\\\\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\\\"}}]\\n61:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"66\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003e4. Test the \\\\\\\"Backdoor Test\\\\\\\":\\u003c/strong\\u003e Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\\\"}}]\\n62:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"67\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003e5. Use Positive Association:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\\\"}}]\\n63:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"68\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\\\"]}]\\n64:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"69\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eRushing the Decision:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\\\"}}]\\n65:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"70\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eChoosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:\\u003c/strong\\u003e A pet named \\\\\\\"Molly\\\\\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\\\"}}]\\n66:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"71\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eNames That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:\\u003c/strong\\u003e You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\\\"}}]\\n67:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"72\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"\\u003cstrong\\u003eIgnoring Breed Heritage:\\u003c/strong\\u003e A Scottish Terrier named \\\\\\\"Haggis\\\\\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\\\\\"Mochi\\\\\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\\\"}}]\\n68:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"73\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"🌍 Unique Cat Names from Around the World\\\"]}]\\n69:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"74\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Looking internationally reveals a treasure trove of unique cat names. Japanese cat names like Yuki (snow), Sora (sky), and Hana (flower) bring elegant simplicity. French names like Bijou (jewel), Chérie (darling), and Minou (kitty) add sophistication. Italian names like Bella, Romeo, and Stella capture passion and beauty. Scandinavian names like Freya, Loki, and Saga connect to Norse mythology. Exploring global naming traditions can lead you to a name that's truly one-of-a-kind.\\\"]}]\\n6a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"75\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Don't forget about names from literature, art, and science. A cat named Frida (after Frida Kahlo), Tesla (after Nikola Tesla), or Zora (after Zora Neale Hurston) carries cultural weight and makes for great conversation. The more unexpected the reference, the more unique the name becomes.\\\"]}]\\n6b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"76\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\\\"]}]\\n6c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"77\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"81\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/axolotl/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Axolotl\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\" names, \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"98\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/chipmunk/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Chipmunk\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\" names, \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"116\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/dwarf-hamster/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Dwarf Hamster\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\" names, \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"139\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/waterbuck/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Waterbuck\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\" names, and \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"162\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/lorikeet/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Lorikeet\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"6d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",nul