 mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Big Purr</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Catzilla</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Dumbledog</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Dog Marley</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Paw Patrol</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n38:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"50\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"41–50\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"p\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Jane Pawsten</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Woofgang Amadeus</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>The Great Catsby</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"54\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Gandalf the Greyhound</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Cat Sajak</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Earthquake</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Kitty Purry</strong> — A clever twist that suits a smart and mischievous companion who always keeps you laughing.\"}}]\n40:[\"$\",\"p\",\"58\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Isaac Mewton</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n41:[\"$\",\"p\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Doctor Woof</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n42:[\"$\",\"p\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Fleaonce</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n43:[\"$\",\"p\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These 50 names represent a diverse collection spanning multiple styles, origins, and inspirations. Each one has been carefully selected for quality and memorability.\"]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"p\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n46:[\"$\",\"p\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n47:[\"$\",\"p\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n48:[\"$\",\"p\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n49:[\"$\",\"p\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🌍 Unique Cat Names from Around the World\"]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"p\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking internationally reveals a treasure trove of unique cat names. Japanese cat names like Yuki (snow), Sora (sky), and Hana (flower) bring elegant simplicity. French names like Bijou (jewel), Chérie (darling), and Minou (kitty) add sophistication. Italian names like Bella, Romeo, and Stella capture passion and beauty. Scandinavian names like Freya, Loki, and Saga connect to Norse mythology. Exploring global naming traditions can lead you to a name that's truly one-of-a-kind.\"]}]\n51:[\"$\",\"p\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Don't forget about names from literature, art, and science. A cat named Frida (after Frida Kahlo), Tesla (after Nikola Tesla), or Zora (after Zora Neale Hurston) carries cultural weight and makes for great conversation. The more unexpected the reference, the more unique the name becomes.\"]}]\n52:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",\"77\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/axolotl/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Axolotl\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"98\",{\"href\":\"/animal/chipmunk/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Chipmunk\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"116\",{\"href\":\"/animal/dwarf-hamster/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Dwarf Hamster\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"139\",{\"href\":\"/animal/waterbuck/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Waterbuck\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"162\",{\"href\":\"/animal/lorikeet/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Lorikeet\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n54:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What makes a cat name unique?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A unique cat name stands out from common names like Luna or Max. It might draw from mythology, foreign languages, rare words, or unexpected inspirations like constellations, spices, or literary characters.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Do cats respond better to certain types of names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Cats respond best to names ending in a high-pitched sound ('ee' sound), like Kitty, Sunny, or Ziggy. Names with sibilant sounds (s, z, sh) also catch feline attention because they mimic the sounds of prey.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What are some unique cat name categories?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Popular unique categories include: celestial names (Andromeda, Nebula), culinary names (Wasabi, Chai, Kimchi), artistic names (Picasso, Frida), mythological names (Freya, Odin), and vintage names (Agatha, Cornelius).\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should my cat's name match its personality?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"It helps! A regal, dignified cat might suit Duchess or Emperor, while a goofy, playful cat might be better as Noodle or Waffles. Observe your cat for a few days before deciding — their personality will guide you.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can a unique name be too complicated?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"While creativity is great, avoid names that are too long or hard to pronounce. A unique but pronounceable name (2-3 syllables max) works best. You'll be saying it many times a day!\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n55:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"cat\",{\"href\":\"/animal/cat/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐱\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Cat\"}]]}],null,[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"siamese-cat\",{\"href\":\"/animal/siamese-cat/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐱\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Siamese Cat\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"persian-cat\",{\"href\":\"/animal/persian-cat/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray